From: ProjectM TV contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Retain HLSL compatibility and finite float32 round trips

Retain the remaining local HLSL parser/emitter fixes on unreleased upstream master 6f6480746. Consolidates the retained portions of historical 0003, 0030, 0031, 0036, 0040 and 0044. Upstream now supplies the original 0008/0018/0019/0021 behavior, so omit those duplicate source changes. Preserve characterization and real-GL render controls. Original patch attribution and value assessment: ProjectM-TV docs/UPSTREAM_PATCH_VALUE.md.

---
diff --git a/tests/libprojectM/PresetShaderTranslationTest.cpp b/tests/libprojectM/PresetShaderTranslationTest.cpp
